[Source 4: oracle-hospitality-property-workflows.postman_collection.json — Upgrade a Reservation in OPERA Cloud using Property APIs]
Workflow: Upgrade a Reservation in OPERA Cloud using Property APIs
Steps: 5

Step 1: Retrieve reservation and see if an upsell offer in OPERA Cloud is available
  GET /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}
  Query: fetchInstructions=Reservation, fetchInstructions=UpsellInfo, allowedActions=Upsell

Step 2: Find available upsell offers configured in OPERA Cloud to present to a guest
  GET /par/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/availableUpsells
  Query: numberOfRooms=1, ratePlanCode=BARBB, roomType=SUP, startDate=2021-03-22, endDate=2021-03-23

Step 3: Add an upsell to a reservation
  POST /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/upsell
  Body:
{
    "hotelId": "{{HotelId}}",
    "reservationId": {
        "type": "Reservation",
        "id": "{{ReservationId}}"
    },
    "upsell": {
        "ruleId": {
            "id": "379",
            "type": "UpsellRuleId"
        },
        "ratePlanCode": "BARBB",
        "roomType": {
            "roomType": "SUP"
        },
        "firstNightAmount": {
            "amount": {
                "amount": 440
            }
        },
        "totalStayAmount": {
            "amount": {
                "amount": 440
            }
        },
        "rates": [
            {
                "date": "2021-03-15",
                "requiredAmount": {
                    "amount": {
                        "amount": 440
                    }
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}

Step 4: Remove an upsell from a reservation
  DELETE /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/upsell

Step 5: See if an upsell exists on a reservation
  GET /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/upsell


