Workflow: Property Interfaces - Guest Messages
Steps: 4

Step 1: Create a New Guest Message
  POST /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages
  Body:
{
    "hotelId": "{{HotelId}}",
    "reservationIdList": {
        "type": "Reservation",
        "id": "{{ReservationId}}"
    },
    "guestMessages": [
        {
            "message": {
                "messageText": "Text Message content",
                "messageDate": "2022-01-18 10:57:15.0",
                "typeOfMessage": "Tm",
                "recipient": "",
                "operator": "External App"
            },
            "delivery": {
                "deliveryStatus": "Nr",
                "textMessageSentBy": "MBOESEL-OHIPSB"
            }
        }
    ]
}

Step 2: Get a Guest Message by reservationId
  GET /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}
  Query: fetchInstructions=GuestMessages

Step 3: Update Guest Message  - update delivered
  PUT /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages/{{GuestMessageId}}
  Body:
{
   "hotelId":"{{HotelId}}",
   "guestMessages":[
      {
         "message":{
            "messageText":"NEW NEW - Yet another new Text Message from Postman",
            "messageDate":"2021-12-21 04:57:15.0",
            "typeOfMessage":"Tm",
            "recipient":"Boesel1, Marcus"
         },
         "delivery":{
            "deliveryStatus":"Mr",
            "deliveryDate": "2021-12-21 09:55:00.0",
            "deliveredBy": "MBOESEL-OHIPSB"
         }
      }
   ]
}

Step 4: Delete a Guest Message by ID
  DELETE /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages/{{GuestMessageId}}


